[size=4][b]Changelog[/b][/size]

[b]1.3.3[/b]
[list]
[*][b]Fertilised Farm Soil[/b] has its own row under Materials (it was counted as Farm Soil).
[*]Zoomed out, forests draw as merged strips and share one budget with the deposit icons, so the map keeps drawing with everything on.
[*]Reported bugs fixed:
[list]
[*]The game could freeze or crash on the World Map with tree types on, when forest names landed on each other (reported by fostot).
[/list]
[/list]

[b]1.3.2[/b]
[list]
[*][b]Minimap Border[/b]: Thin swaps the ornate frame for a fine line, so the map takes less room. Requested by fraidnot, HadToRegister and fostot.
[*][b]Minimap Info Bar[/b]: turn off the bar under the minimap (time, weather, zoom buttons); the cog moves to the map's bottom-left corner. Requested by fostot.
[*]Reported bugs fixed: none.
[/list]

[b]1.3.1[/b]
[list]
[*][b]Minimap[/b]: nearby chests above or below you get a green up or orange down arrow. Requested by Lomack.
[*][b]Minimap[/b]: other players show in the Hollow Halls too.
[*]Reported bugs fixed: none.
[/list]

[b]1.3.0[/b]
[list]
[*][b]Mining[/b]: every ore deposit in the world, 21 kinds, on the world map, the minimap and in Find, each with its own row in the Map Key.
[*][b]Materials, Plants and Bait[/b]: farm soil, twigs, tar, ice, 30 plants, fireflies, frogs and more, the same way.
[*][b]Trees[/b]: every forest drawn as a shape in its tree type's colour, with the big ones named.
[*]Two more zoom steps out on the world map. Requested by HadToRegister.
[*]The Map Key scrolls (mouse wheel or scroll bar), SHOW ALL / HIDE ALL are back at its top, and the category bars look like the game's own.
[*]Looted chests are shared: players who have the mod see the chests the others open.
[*]Reported bugs fixed:
[list]
[*]Some quests and lore rumors hid under other icons (reported by Deadcow67 and KazarusKain).
[*]Show on Map (F) in the Journal opened the map on the player instead of the quest (reported by sandesign, Loling91 and KazarusKain).
[*]With a gamepad, the map cursor didn't move after tabbing to the map (reported by Chocobostew).
[/list]
[/list]

[b]1.2.0[/b]
[list]
[*][b]Settings[/b] (the cog on the Map Key, and under the minimap): Show All / Hide All, fog, the new pin modes, custom marker size, minimap on or off, minimap terrain, sun/moon or weather, and looted chests hidden or grayed out.
[*][b]Pin modes[/b]: EXPLORED shows pins only where you've been, HYBRID grays out pins in unexplored land, REVEAL ALL shows them all. Requested by dremen and KazarusKain.
[*][b]Completed quests[/b] have their own filter (off at first), so Main Quest and Side Quest show only the quests you're on. Requested by inShaneity, KazarusKain and Deadcow67.
[*][b]Looted chests[/b]: open a gold or silver chest and it's marked looted, hidden or grayed out with a check mark. Ctrl + left click a chest on the map to mark it or clear the mark. Chests come back after 30 minutes of play unless they're in a Flame Altar's build zone. Saved per world. Requested by inShaneity and FWSWBN.
[*][b]Minimap[/b]: the World Map's terrain under it and check marks on cleared places (requested by inShaneity), weather in place of the sun or moon (requested by Loling91), an option to hide it (requested by FWSWBN), and other players as colored arrows that show where they're heading.
[*][b]Custom Marker Size[/b] for your own pins. Requested by dremen.
[*]The map's hint bar shows the mod's keys: Ctrl+click, Shift+F and Tab.
[*]Reported bugs fixed: none.
[/list]

[b]1.1.0[/b]
[list]
[*]The mod's text in all 15 languages the game supports, following the game's language (or [i]Language=[/i] in [i]minimap_config.ini[/i]). The map key widens to fit longer labels. Requested by Loling91.
[*]Find ignores upper and lower case in every script, finds places by their English type name in any language, and no longer cuts names in the middle of a character.
[*]Reported bugs fixed: none.
[/list]

[b]1.0.0[/b]
[list]
[*]First release.
[/list]

